# Working scratch. TRACKED FILES UNDER .scratch/ ARE UNAFFECTED — a .gitignore never applies to a
# path already in the index, so `.scratch/console-svelte/` (the issue tracker, 16 files) stays.
#
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC, and this line exists because of a near miss: a session left Playwright
# screenshots in `.scratch/liveshots/` that rendered a private run's identifiers as PIXELS. No text
# grep would ever have found them, and they were one reflexive `git add -A` from publication. The
# directory is where people put previews, traces and renders of real data; ignoring it by default is
# the only version of this that survives someone being in a hurry.
.scratch/
